    "Begins charging the Tesla's battery when the car is plugged in, up to its charge limit. Use when the user wants the car to charge now. Fails with a clear message if the car isn't plugged in.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicia la carga de la batería del Tesla cuando está conectado, hasta su límite. Falla con un aviso claro si no está enchufado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
