    "Check software on ${vehicle}": {},
    "Check software on my car": {},
    "Checks a Tesla vehicle's current battery percentage, estimated driving range in miles, charge limit, and active charging status. Omit the vehicle parameter to inspect the user's selected car.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consulta el porcentaje de batería, autonomía estimada, límite y estado de carga de un Tesla. Omite el vehículo para el seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks a Tesla vehicle's tire pressure monitoring system (TPMS) readings in PSI for front-left, front-right, rear-left, and rear-right tires. Omit the vehicle parameter to inspect the user's selected car.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consulta las lecturas TPMS de presión de los cuatro neumáticos de un Tesla. Omite el vehículo para el seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks whether the car's Tesla firmware has a software update (read-only): the installed version, any newer version, and whether it's downloading (with progress), ready to install, scheduled, or installing, plus how long the install takes. To hear what's new, use the Read Release Notes tool. To install, use the Install Software Update tool.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba si el Tesla tiene una actualización de firmware: versión instalada, versión nueva, progreso y duración estimada. Usa Leer notas o Instalar actualización para otras acciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose open to open and unlock the charge port, or close to close the motorized charge port door.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige abrir para abrir y desbloquear el puerto de carga, o cerrar para cerrar la tapa motorizada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
