    "Unlocks the doors on the user's car (or Tesla) after asking the user for confirmation. Use when the user says \"unlock my car\" or \"unlock my Tesla\". Omit the vehicle parameter to unlock the user's selected car.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desbloquea las puertas del vehículo tras pedir confirmación. Omite el vehículo para el seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlocks the doors, opens the trunk, frunk, or charge port, or turns off Sentry Mode on the user's car (or Tesla), after asking the user to confirm. Pass every action the user asked for in one call. For locking, climate, charging, and other changes, use the Control Car tool.": {
      "comment": "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desbloquea las puertas, abre el maletero, el maletero delantero o el puerto de carga, o desactiva el Modo Centinela del Tesla, tras pedir confirmación. Pasa todas las acciones solicitadas en una sola llamada. Para bloquear, clima, carga y otros cambios usa Controlar vehículo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
